WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,160
Help me! Help me! I don’t know the secret of being eaten by a cat

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,880
Woooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooooo

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,920
OK then

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,900
Xiaoyu, you grow up well, oh oh oh oh oh oh

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,200
Thank you female Bodhisattva

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,200
It turns out there are people in this world who care

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,700
You don’t want to live next time

8
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,620
I'll bring Mimi here for a nice meal

9
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:18,520
How long have you seen each other?

10
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,640
In the pure land of Buddhism

11
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,680
It also made me meet the devil

12
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:23,810
What are you talking about?

13
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:25,390
Baby, are you hungry?

14
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:27,210
There's Suzai over there, do you want to eat?

15
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,460
And there is magical power in it

16
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,180
Originally, the fence was not very good.

17
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:41,180
I saw him actually eating half a bowl of rice.

18
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,980
Amitabha

19
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,880
Accompany the old gentleman and the old lady

20
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,180
Long time no see

21
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,180
I feel more at ease lately

22
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,960
As expected of Master Miao Kong

23
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,160
Don't hide anything from each other

24
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:55,930
We are troubled by an old incident, brother

25
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:58,030
My feet hurt from looking for you

26
00:00:58,330 --> 00:00:59,430
You don't even wait for me

27
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:02,780
How are you going to make up for my Jiaojiao?

28
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,580
Try this crispy crab noodle

29
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,480
Made with potatoes, carrots and nails

30
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,480
But it tastes very similar to crab powder
